tn't be like a little star drifting away. That's why the Little Stars is the homeland of this continent And to learn all that one will expand your learning How you should live in this country And firstly you must learn all these archives In the whole Urakulu The law, the skin name, the land, the ceremony and the language Thank you. And aim you."}, {"start": "00:44:58", "end": "00:45:49", "text": "Your country will know you. Satsang with Mooji"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:00"}, "track": {"title": "Perfect Organism", "artists": [{"name": "Prime Mover"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:13:30"}, "track": {"title": "Deep Umbel", "artists": [{"name": "Troth"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:38:00"}, "track": {"title": "NGURRA KURLU (HOME)", "artists": [{"name": "Crown and Country"}, {"name": "Jerry Jangala Patrick"}, {"name": "MWNCI & Wanta Jampijinpa Pawu-Kurlpurlurnu"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:46:25"}, "track": {"title": "Show Me Love", "artists": [{"name": "Robin S."}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:49:00"}, "track": {"title": "I Want C & B to Fix My Car", "artists": [{"name": "Boof"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:51:00"}, "track": {"title": "Smoker Racer", "artists": [{"name": "DJ Dodge"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:52:00"}, "track": {"title": "Pressure", "artists": [{"name": "Jesse Rose & Avon Stringer"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:53:53"}, "track": {"title": "Bush Honey (guku) [feat. Peter Knight, Aviva Endean & Sunny Kim]", "artists": [{"name": "Hand To Earth"}]}, "isPre